      "expected_behavior": "Agent should provide specific information in response to: Lighting fixture",
      "agent_response": "Tom Dixon Melt Pendant (Large, Antique Brass) — a sculptural, molten-metal glass pendant that adds a modern, artistic focal point and warm reflective light to a living room; use a dimmable LED bulb and hang it over the seating area at about 30–36 inches above the coffee table (or centered in the room if no table).",
      "duration_s": 8.091,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "user_message": "I like that Lighting fixture. I'm going with that Lighting fixture. Can you save that Lighting fixture for me?",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should save/remember the Lighting fixture it just suggested",
      "agent_response": "Saved — I’ve recorded your chosen fixture: Tom Dixon Melt Pendant (Large, Antique Brass). Notes saved with it: sculptural molten‑glass pendant; use a dimmable LED bulb; hang about 30–36\" above the coffee table (or centered if no table).\n\nWould you like me to:\n- Draft an email to a seller/contractor to get pricing/availability?\n- Find purchase links and specs for you?\n- Add a reminder or calendar item to buy/install it?\n\nTell me which and I’ll take care of it.",
