      "expected_behavior": "Agent should save/remember the Music genre it just suggested",
      "agent_response": "Saved — I’ve recorded your chosen genre: Indie folk as the music style for your school event.\n\nWould you like me to:\n- Create a playlist of indie-folk tracks?\n- Find suggested artists or sample setlist?\n- Draft an email to a DJ/volunteer with the genre and logistics?\n- Add a reminder or calendar item for music planning?\n\nWhich one should I do next?",
      "duration_s": 7.133,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "user_message": "I'm working on setting up my home garden and need a specific tool recommendation. What is one specific brand and model of a high-quality garden hose you suggest I consider? Just give me one specific brand and model, no options.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should provide specific information in response to: \"brand and model\"",
      "agent_response": "Flexzilla Garden Hose — 5/8 in. x 50 ft. Lightweight Hybrid Polymer Garden Hose (ZillaGreen).",
      "duration_s": 6.04,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 6,
      "user_message": "I've made up my mind. I want to use that \"brand and model\" you suggested for my home garden. Please remember it for me.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should save/remember the \"brand and model\" it just suggested",
      "agent_response": "Saved — I’ve recorded your chosen garden hose: Flexzilla Garden Hose — 5/8 in. x 50 ft. Lightweight Hybrid Polymer Garden Hose (ZillaGreen).\n\nNotes saved: durable, lightweight hybrid-polymer hose; kink-resistant; good for everyday watering.\n\nWould you like me to:\n- Draft an email to a seller/store to ask about pricing/availability?\n- Find purchase links, specs, and reviews?\n- Add a reminder or calendar item to buy/install it?\n\nWhich one should I do next?",
      "duration_s": 5.989,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 7,
      "user_message": "I'm organizing a birthday party with a tropical theme. What specific fruit punch recipe do you recommend for the party? Just give me one concrete recipe, no options.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should provide specific information in response to: \"fruit punch recipe\"",
      "agent_response": "Tropical Pineapple–Mango Punch (concrete recipe)\n\nYield: ~20 (8-oz) servings\n\nIngredients\n- 8 cups (64 oz) pineapple juice  \n- 3 cups (24 oz) mango nectar or mango puree thinned with 1/4 cup water  \n- 2 cups (16 oz) fresh orange juice  \n- 1 cup (8 oz) coconut water  \n- 1/2 cup (4 oz) fresh lime juice (about 4–5 limes)  \n- 1/3 cup (2.7 oz) simple syrup (adjust to taste) or 1/4 cup if your juices are very sweet  \n- 1/4 cup (2 oz) grenadine (for color; optional)  \n- 2 liters (about 67.6 oz) ginger ale or club soda, chilled — add just before serving  \n- Ice and large bowl or beverage dispenser\n\nOptional adult version: 2 cups light rum (add when combining juices)\n\nGarnish (optional)\n- Pineapple rings or wedges, orange slices, lime wheels, fresh mint sprigs, maraschino cherries\n\nDirections\n1. In a large pitcher or beverage dispenser, combine pineapple juice, mango nectar/puree, orange juice, coconut water, lime juice, simple syrup, and grenadine. Stir well.  \n2. Taste and adjust sweetness (add a little more simple syrup) or acidity (more lime) as needed. If making the adult version, stir in the rum now.  \n3. Chill the mixture at least 1 hour (or up to 24 hours) so flavors meld.  \n4. Just before serving, add the chilled ginger ale or club soda and gently stir to preserve fizz. Add a large ice block or ice in a separate bowl to avoid diluting the punch too quickly.  \n5. Float fruit garnish and mint on top and ladle into glasses with fresh ice.\n\nMake-ahead tips\n- Mix the juice base (everything except ginger ale and ice) up to 24 hours ahead and refrigerate. Add ginger ale and ice right before guests arrive.  \n- For a showpiece, freeze pineapple slices into a large ice ring to keep the dispenser cold without dilution.\n\nEnjoy — this is bright, tropical, and crowd-pleasing for a themed birthday party.",
      "duration_s": 14.438,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 8,
      "user_message": "I'm redecorating my home office. What specific type of chair would you recommend for a comfortable and ergonomic workspace? Just give me one specific chair recommendation, no options.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should provide specific information in response to: \"office chair\"",
      "agent_response": "Herman Miller Aeron (Remastered) — an ergonomic mesh office chair with PostureFit SL lumbar support, fully adjustable armrests, tilt and recline controls, and breathable Pellicle mesh. Tip: set seat height so your elbows are level with the desk and adjust the lumbar support to fit the natural curve of your lower back.",
      "duration_s": 7.082,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 9,
      "user_message": "I've decided on that \"office chair\" for my home office. Please remember that \"office chair\" for me.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should save/remember the \"office chair\" it just suggested",
      "agent_response": "Saved — I’ve recorded your chosen office chair: Herman Miller Aeron (Remastered).\n\nNotes saved: ergonomic mesh chair with PostureFit SL lumbar support; fully adjustable armrests, tilt/recline controls; breathable Pellicle mesh. Tip: set seat height so your elbows are level with the desk and adjust lumbar to fit your lower-back curve.\n\nWould you like me to:\n- Draft an email to a seller/store to ask about pricing/availability?\n- Find purchase links, specs, and reviews?\n- Add a reminder or calendar item to buy/setup it?\n\nWhich one should I do next?",
      "duration_s": 5.545,
      "success_check": null
    },
    {
      "step": 10,
      "user_message": "I'm enhancing my kitchen decor with new cookware. What specific color and finish do you recommend for a set of high-quality non-stick pots and pans? Just give me one concrete color with finish type, no options.",
