      "user_message": "I'm working on updating my home decor and want to add a touch of elegance with a specific type of window treatment. What is one specific type of window treatment you recommend for a classic and sophisticated look in my living room? Just give me one recommendation, no options.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should provide specific information in response to: \"curtains\"",
      "agent_response": "Silk-lined, custom floor-to-ceiling pinch-pleat draperies in a neutral (e.g., ivory or warm gray) — classic, elegant, and structured; use a heavy silk or silk-blend face fabric with a full lining for drape and insulation.\n\nTip: mount the rod 4–6 inches above the window (or to the ceiling for extra height) and extend the rod 8–12 inches beyond each side so the panels stack clear of the glass when open.",
      "duration_s": 7.459,
